System FFmpeg (also used by the recorders), v4l2-ctl, Python, device drivers,
SteamVR, the Pico SDK, TinyUSB, the ARM toolchain and other system/build
dependencies retain their own distribution-specific terms. SteamVR is subject
to Valve's applicable terms. The Record3D iPhone app used by the DexUMI and
UMI recorders is a separate commercial app under its own terms. hatchling is
